.mdx",{"_22":172,"_29":69,"_44":-7,"_24":173},"es:_4","Resolución de problemas",{"_22":175,"_29":41,"_24":176,"_35":177,"_44":-7,"_10":178,"_46":179},"es:platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas PKI","Diagnostica emisión de certificados, OCSP y CRL.","/docs/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting",{"_48":180},"platform/pki/troubleshooting.mdx","es:platform/pki",{"_183":184},"metaFile","platform/pki/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>","index",{"_22":188,"_29":41,"_24":65,"_35":189,"_44":-7,"_10":190,"_46":191},"es:platform/pki/overview.mdx","Administra claves y autoridades, define la emisión y verifica los certificados resultantes.","/docs/es/platform/pki/overview",{"_48":192},"platform/pki/overview.mdx",{"_29":30,"_24":194,"_32":-7,"_34":-7,"_35":-7,"_37":-7,"_26":195,"_22":304,"_46":305,"_44":307,"_186":308},"IoT Fleets",[196,198,205,212,215,221,290],{"_22":197,"_29":69,"_44":-7,"_24":70},"es:_5",{"_22":199,"_29":41,"_24":200,"_35":201,"_44":-7,"_10":202,"_46":203},"es:platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device.mdx","Enrola y conecta tu primer dispositivo","Obtén una identidad por EST, verifica su asociación y úsala en una conexión mTLS.","/docs/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device",{"_48":204},"platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device.mdx",{"_22":206,"_29":41,"_24":207,"_35":208,"_44":-7,"_10":209,"_46":210},"es:platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device.mdx","Registra un dispositivo manualmente","Prepara un DMS, registra un dispositivo y asocia un certificado comprobado a 